{
    "chapter_num": 3,
    "verses_count": 18,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Christ’s Epistle"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Do we begin again to commend ourselves? Or do we need, as some "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "others"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", epistles of commendation to you or "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "letters"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of commendation from you? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You are our epistle written in our hearts, known and read by all men; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "clearly you are an epistle of Christ, ministered by us, written not with ink but by the Spirit of the living God, not on tablets of stone but on tablets of flesh, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that is,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the heart."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Spirit, Not the Letter"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And we have such trust through Christ toward God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Not that we are sufficient of ourselves to think of anything as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "being"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from ourselves, but our sufficiency "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from God, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who also made us sufficient as ministers of the new covenant, not of the letter but of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or spirit"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Spirit; for the letter kills, but the Spirit gives life."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Glory of the New Covenant"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But if the ministry of death, written "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " engraved on stones, was glorious, so that the children of Israel could not look steadily at the face of Moses because of the glory of his countenance, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "glory"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " was passing away, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "how will the ministry of the Spirit not be more glorious? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if the ministry of condemnation "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "had"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " glory, the ministry of righteousness exceeds much more in glory. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For even what was made glorious had no glory in this respect, because of the glory that excels. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For if what is passing away "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "was"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " glorious, what remains "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " much more glorious."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, since we have such hope, we use great boldness of speech— "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "unlike Moses, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "who"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " put a veil over his face so that the children of Israel could not look steadily at the end of what was passing away. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But their minds were blinded. For until this day the same veil remains unlifted in the reading of the Old Testament, because the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "veil"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " is taken away in Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But even to this day, when Moses is read, a veil lies on their heart. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Nevertheless when one turns to the Lord, the veil is taken away. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now the Lord is the Spirit; and where the Spirit of the Lord "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ", there "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " liberty. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But we all, with unveiled face, beholding as in a mirror the glory of the Lord, are being transformed into the same image from glory to glory, just as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or from the Lord, the Spirit"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "by the Spirit of the Lord."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}